                "content": "LANDSCAPE INVENTORY:\n- corp.itsm: IT service management\n- sap.ariba: Procurement/supply chain (vendor-facing)\n- sap.s4: ERP (agents for orders, not APIs)\n- siemens.plm: PLM systems\n- sap.ehs: Safety/EHS\n- workday.hcm: HR/HCM\n- sap.sf: SuccessFactors\n- emarsys.cx: CX/engagement\n- my.mes: MES (manufacturing execution)\n- sap.crm: Sales/CRM (opportunity/campaign focused, NO order APIs)\n- sap.odm: Entity type taxonomy\n\nCRITICAL FINDINGS - SALES ORDER MANAGEMENT:\nActivity: \"Access customer's recent purchases and modify one of their orders before it ships out\"\n- SAP CRM: Agents only (OpportunityQualificationAdvisor, CampaignAudienceOptimization, SalesProductChangeCoordinator, etc.)\n  - NO API resources for customer account access or order management\n  - No order modification capabilities\n- SAP S4: Has agent OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine (creates orders from opportunities)\n  - File truncated, but search suggests no customer order retrieval/modification APIs\n- SAP Ariba: Has PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI (VENDOR-facing, not customer sales orders)\n  - Wrong direction of business flow\n  - Not for customer order management\n\nCONFIRMED GAP:\nNO customer sales order management capability found (access/retrieve/modify customer orders).\nThis is different from:\n- Purchase order management (vendor-facing) = SAP Ariba\n- Opportunity-to-order automation (creating orders) = SAP S4 agent\n- Order creation APIs = not found\n\nThe landscape appears focused on opportunity->order creation (agents) and vendor procurement, but lacks:\n- Customer account access APIs\n- Customer order retrieval APIs  \n- Customer order modification APIs\n- Pre-shipment order change capabilities\n"
